      "side": 1,
      "message": "Reproduced on a system with multiple boards implementing\nxyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Decorator.Compatible but no JSON\nconfig staged for fan-presence/fan-control.\n\nBefore fix: compatIntfAdded() calls _loadFunc() with no try/catch.\nentity-manager publishing each board\u0027s compatible interface fires\ninterfacesAdded, which crashes both services:\n```\nJul 30 22:31:49 bmc entity-manager[1511]: Inventory Added: Santa Barbara PCIe switch board\nJul 30 22:31:49 bmc entity-manager[1511]: Inventory Added: Santa Barbara MB\nJul 30 22:31:54 bmc phosphor-fan-presence-tach[1533]: terminate called after throwing an instance of \u0027phosphor::fan::NoConfigFound\u0027\nJul 30 22:31:54 bmc phosphor-fan-control[1032]: terminate called after throwing an instance of \u0027phosphor::fan::NoConfigFound\u0027\nJul 30 22:31:54 bmc systemd-coredump[1880]: Process 1533 (phosphor-fan-pr) of user 0 terminated abnormally with signal 6/ABRT\n```\n\n\nTo confirm the fix, we added a debug log inside the new catch block\nand re-tested. Same two boards\u0027 entity-manager events now get caught\nand logged instead of crashing:\n```\nAug 02 21:03:06 bmc entity-manager[1511]: Inventory Added: Santa Barbara PCIe switch board\nAug 02 21:03:06 bmc entity-manager[1511]: Inventory Added: Santa Barbara MB\nAug 02 21:03:10 bmc phosphor-fan-control[1030]: compatIntfAdded: caught NoConfigFound after interfacesAdded, compatible\u003dcom.meta.Hardware.Santabarbara.Boards.PCIe_Switch_Board, error\u003dJSON configuration not found [Could not find fan control conf file zones.json]\nAug 02 21:03:10 bmc phosphor-fan-presence-tach[1546]: compatIntfAdded: caught NoConfigFound after interfacesAdded, compatible\u003dcom.meta.Hardware.Santabarbara.Boards.PCIe_Switch_Board, error\u003dJSON configuration not found [Could not find fan presence conf file config.json]\nAug 02 21:03:10 bmc phosphor-fan-control[1030]: compatIntfAdded: caught NoConfigFound after interfacesAdded, compatible\u003dcom.meta.Hardware.Santabarbara.Boards.MB, error\u003dJSON configuration not found [Could not find fan control conf file zones.json]\nAug 02 21:03:10 bmc phosphor-fan-presence-tach[1546]: compatIntfAdded: caught NoConfigFound after interfacesAdded, compatible\u003dcom.meta.Hardware.Santabarbara.Boards.MB, error\u003dJSON configuration not found [Could not find fan presence conf file config.json]\n```\nVerified all 6 boards trigger this catch path with no crash,\ncoredump, restart, or terminate.",
